# Allowlist, not a denylist. `outputDirectory` in vercel.json controls what is
# *served*; it does not control what is *uploaded*. The Vercel CLI sends the project
# source tree on every deploy, so without this file `memory/`, `tasks/`, `docs/`,
# `reports/` and `PROJECT_KANBAN*.md` would go to a third party. Enumerating what to
# exclude fails open the first time a new folder appears, so deny everything and
# admit only what the deploy needs.
*
!site/
!site/**
!vercel.json
